===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

1. someone who looks after on an unpaid basis for an ill,frail or disabled partner, relative or friend
#:''He retired early to be a full-time '''carer''' for his wife / husband.''


2. someone who looks after another either as a job 
#:''Have you thought of a job as a '''carer''' for [[disabled]] people?''

